(259, 'Acqua Di Gio – Fresh Ocean Breeze Classic', 'COD20261017259', 'acqua-di-gio-fresh-ocean-breeze-classic', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '353252584609', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-31YlZ5FbcJwvREc7Q1Grc2ShQ5QkfXRWHTzbsSNI.webp', 'Classic ocean-fresh marine perfume for daily and office wear.Top Notes: Lime, Lemon, Bergamot, Jasmine, Orange, NeroliMiddle Notes: Sea Notes, Calone, Peach, Freesia, RosemaryBase Notes: White Musk, Cedar, Oakmoss, Patchouli, AmberScent Profile: Marine • Citrus • Fresh • WoodyBest For: Daily & office wear, summer', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Inspired by the pristine Mediterranean sea, Acqua Di Gio captures clean marine notes balanced with sunny citrus and light woody undertones. The quintessential effortless fragrance.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Scent Journey: It opens bright and sun-filled with lime, lemon, bergamot, jasmine, orange and neroli. The heart brings a clean, marine freshness with sea notes, calone, peach, freesia and rosemary. It rests on a soft, woody base of white musk, cedar, oakmoss, patchouli and amber.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Perfect For: A classic ocean-fresh choice for daily and office wear, especially in summer and warm weather. Clean, light and easy to wear all day.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 1400.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acqua Di Gio – Fresh Ocean Breeze Classic (Airas Mart)', 'Acqua Di Gio – Fresh Ocean Breeze Classic (Airas Mart)', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-BtRFJSDXOhOHm2LG5HJiHZ1s3oWvTjceQW3qMz6x.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-17 10:03:35', '2026-11-08 11:32:02'),
(260, 'Hawas Fire / Ice – Fresh Fruity Summer Beast', 'COD20261019260', 'hawas-fire-ice-fresh-fruity-summer-beast', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '649752410633', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-DmYMMoU9AsCHti5S6Y9TyoRErdmZZcUVYyBPZsix.webp', '<p>High-performance fresh aquatic & fruity summer powerhouse.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Frozen Apple, Bergamot, Lemon, Star Anise</p><p>Middle Notes: Plum, Orange Blossom, Cardamom</p><p>Base Notes: Driftwood, Amber, Musk, Moss</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Fresh • Fruity • Aquatic • Spicy</p><p>Best For: Summer, hot & humid days, active outings</p>', '<p>Hawas is built for heat and high activity. It delivers an invigorating explosion of crisp aquatic freshness, juicy fruit and energetic spice, designed for men who want strong projection even on humid days.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with an icy, juicy burst of frozen apple, bergamot, lemon and star anise. The heart adds fruity and spicy energy with plum, orange blossom and cardamom. It dries down into a fresh, ambery base of driftwood, amber, musk and moss.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for summer, hot and humid weather, outings and busy days. A fresh, fruity powerhouse that stays lively through the day.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 1000.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hawas Fire / Ice – Fresh Fruity Summer Beast', 'High-performance fresh aquatic & fruity summer powerhouse.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTop Notes: Frozen Apple, Bergamot, Lemon, Star Anise\r\n\r\nMiddle Notes: Plum, Orange Blossom, Cardamom\r\n\r\nBase Notes: Driftwood, Amber, Musk, Moss\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nScent Profile: Fresh • Fruity • Aquatic • Spicy\r\n\r\nBest For: Summer, hot & humid days, active outings', 'storage/media/product/2026-10-19-ff2Icv5bsdZHEdLtAS8rdbSbD2wqcooPseIf7Zam.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-18 21:27:08', '2026-11-08 10:17:33'),
(261, 'Vampire Blood – Dark Berries & Smoky Amber', 'COD20261019261', 'vampire-blood-dark-berries-smoky-amber', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '408068216068', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-Yvhv15pRpQPVDRemigHc7WfPqs8e00CDLtzvzMr9.webp', '<p>Dark plum, blackberries, crimson rose, and smoky amber.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Dark Blackberries, Red Plum, Blood Orange</p><p>Middle Notes: Crimson Rose, Night-Blooming Jasmine, Wild Strawberry</p><p>Base Notes: Smoky Amber, Dark Vanilla, Patchouli, Cashmere Musk</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Dark Berry • Floral • Amber • Smoky</p><p>Best For: Nights, parties, special occasions</p>', '<p>A thrilling creation for those who dare to be different. Rich dark plum and juicy berries collide with crimson rose and smoky amber, creating an alluringly dark, sweet and enigmatic sillage.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a dark, juicy burst of dark blackberries, red plum and blood orange. The heart turns floral and sweet with crimson rose, night-blooming jasmine and wild strawberry. It dries down into a smoky, sensual base of smoky amber, dark vanilla, patchouli and cashmere musk.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Made for night-time, parties and special occasions. A mysterious, seductive unisex scent for anyone who wants to stand out from the crowd.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 300.00, 270.00, 10.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vampire Blood – Dark Berries & Smoky Amber', 'Vampire Blood Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Dark Berry & Crimson Rose | MH Gallery', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-CwOTbYzvPCYnpO62fJzCfMDxReEp5kNSu35E7mOY.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-19 00:07:19', '2026-11-08 21:12:14'),
(262, 'Club De Nuit Intense Man – Smoky Citrus Powerhouse', 'COD20261019262', 'club-de-nuit-intense-man-smoky-citrus-powerhouse', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '654349487776', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-8UjFbeOEaKSsZdvRBnqo7YvRpqQiV4ePwsz4Osgv.webp', '<p>Iconic smoky citrus and pineapple scent with beast-mode projection.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Lemon, Pineapple, Blackcurrant, Bergamot, Apple</p><p>Middle Notes: Birch, Jasmine, Rose</p><p>Base Notes: Musk, Ambergris, Patchouli, Vanilla</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Citrus • Smoky • Fruity • Musky</p><p>Best For: Everyday wear, meetings, night outs</p>', '<p>Club De Nuit Intense Man is an iconic, mass-appealing signature scent. It blends vibrant citrus and pineapple with smoky birch and deep musk, delivering the strong projection and trail this fragrance is loved for.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: The opening is a vibrant, sparkling rush of lemon, pineapple, blackcurrant, bergamot and apple. The heart is a smoky, floral blend of birch, jasmine and rose. Everything settles into a deep, long-lasting base of musk, ambergris, patchouli and vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A versatile choice for everyday wear, executive meetings and night outs. Wear it when you want a confident, polished presence that gets noticed.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Club De Nuit Intense Man – Smoky Citrus Powerhouse', 'Get Club De Nuit Intense Man Extrait De Parfum at MH Gallery. Smoky pineapple & birch profile with legendary longevity and sillage.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-oxLgFZ3RyQg2ENvtfgGbZqAxJLMQwiAlU5ZM1Byf.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-19 04:01:25', '2026-11-08 11:31:28'),
(263, 'Bleu De Chanel – Classy Fresh Woody Aromatic', 'COD20261025263', 'bleu-de-chanel-classy-fresh-woody-aromatic', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '766340745684', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-luESGfPCgzqvMM8lfPj1X10Mg4L7OPMoRLGd3aDB.webp', '<p>Classy, fresh, and professional aromatic-woody scent.</p><p>Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper</p><p>Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine, Iso E Super</p><p>Base Notes: Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli</p><p>Scent Profile: Aromatic • Woody • Fresh • Citrus</p><p>Best For: Office, daily & casual wear</p>', '<p>A versatile aromatic-woody fragrance made for the modern gentleman. Crisp grapefruit and mint open the scent, which then settles into a refined, warm and woody character. Classy, fresh and professional.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens crisp and fresh with grapefruit, lemon, mint and pink pepper. The heart turns refined and warm with ginger, nutmeg, jasmine and Iso E Super. It rests on a dry, woody base of incense, vetiver, cedar, sandalwood and patchouli.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: The supreme daily driver for the office, meetings and casual wear. Timeless, understated and easy to wear in almost any setting.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bleu De Chanel Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Classy Blue Fragrance | MH Gallery', 'Shop Bleu De Chanel impression at MH Gallery. Fresh grapefruit, mint, and woody incense blend for classy everyday office wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-10-25-Omm2Fr8FjwLQqbT0oCpstKO6Lsn9GW6Y61ZwvzCd.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:21:55', '2026-11-08 10:45:47'),
(264, 'Versace Eros – Fresh Mint, Sweet Vanilla Passion', 'COD20261025264', 'versace-eros-fresh-mint-sweet-vanilla-passion', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '519911066555', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-LJpdQ8BhgIYUklhH2F0yXnKqNGvCHBGjpx2bsXgA.webp', '<p>Seductive mint, green apple, and rich vanilla party scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Mint, Green Apple, Lemon</p><p>Middle Notes: Tonka Bean, Ambroxan, Geranium</p><p>Base Notes: Madagascar Vanilla, Virginian Cedar, Atlas Cedar, Vetiver</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Fresh • Minty • Sweet • Vanilla</p><p>Best For: Parties, date nights, evenings out</p>', '<p>Inspired by Greek mythology, Eros opens with an exhilarating blast of mint and crisp green apple before revealing a seductive heart of warm tonka bean. Fresh, sweet and irresistibly tempting.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with an exhilarating blast of mint, green apple and lemon. The heart turns warm and sweet with tonka bean, ambroxan and geranium. It dries down into a seductive base of Madagascar vanilla, Virginian cedar, Atlas cedar and vetiver.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A perfect party and date-night scent for men who love a fresh-sweet, attention-grabbing profile. Great for evenings out and special occasions.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Versace Eros Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Passionate Mint & Vanilla | MH Gallery', 'Buy Versace Eros impression at MH Gallery. Vibrant mint, crisp green apple & creamy vanilla crafted for clubbing and night outs.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-LJpdQ8BhgIYUklhH2F0yXnKqNGvCHBGjpx2bsXgA.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:25:04', '2026-11-08 10:33:31'),
(265, 'YSL Black Opium – Addictive Coffee & Vanilla Night Scent', 'COD20261025265', 'ysl-black-opium-addictive-coffee-vanilla-night-scent', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '658850106772', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-jqlTdtSNa5LlBWVMFDxwJBqj5o2lsqS9ZyA6pBNq.webp', '<p>Addictive black coffee, vanilla, and sweet floral nighttime aura.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Pear, Pink Pepper, Orange Blossom</p><p>Middle Notes: Coffee, Jasmine, Bitter Almond, Licorice</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Patchouli, Cedar, Cashmere Wood</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Sweet • Coffee • Vanilla • Floral</p><p>Best For: Night outs, parties, date nights</p>', '<p>A daring scent for the modern woman. Rich shots of black coffee are sweetened with creamy vanilla and soft white flowers, creating a mysterious, highly addictive dark aura.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a sweet, sparkling touch of pear, pink pepper and orange blossom. The heart turns dark and addictive with coffee, jasmine, bitter almond and licorice. It melts into a creamy, warm base of vanilla, patchouli, cedar and cashmere wood.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: The ultimate night-out fragrance, made for parties, dinners, date nights and cooler evenings. Warm, sweet and seductive.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Opium Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Addictive Coffee & Vanilla | MH Gallery', 'Order YSL Black Opium impression at MH Gallery. Dark roasted coffee, sweet vanilla & white floral notes for glamorous evening wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-oSuJgYzVA5rv6r63vBqAhLUMVXh1If89qxhcjz96.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:29:36', '2026-11-08 11:33:41'),
(266, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille – Rich Tobacco & Creamy Vanilla', 'COD20261025266', 'tom-ford-tobacco-vanille-rich-tobacco-creamy-vanilla', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '423322681232', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-cxR17F4fi2gRUGEXPUee7YA3iByMsqoJukscoZCH.webp', '<p>Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices, cacao, and rich vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Tobacco Leaf, Spicy Notes</p><p>Middle Notes: Vanilla, Cacao, Tonka Bean, Tobacco Blossom</p><p>Base Notes: Dried Fruits, Woody Notes</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Tobacco • Spicy • Vanilla • Warm</p><p>Best For: Evenings, winter, special occasions</p>', '<p>Reminiscent of a classic English gentleman\'s club. Opulent aromatic spices, sweet tobacco leaf, rich cacao and smooth vanilla come together in a powerful statement scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a rich, aromatic mix of tobacco leaf and spicy notes. The heart turns smooth and sweet with vanilla, cacao, tonka bean and tobacco blossom. It finishes with a warm base of dried fruits and woody notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evenings, winter and special occasions. A luxurious unisex fragrance for those who like a rich, warm and memorable presence.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 300.00, 246.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Opulent Warm Spice', 'Shop Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille impression at MH Gallery. Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices & creamy vanilla for private club elegance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-vQUQbeFbdQogb4cN0zqBg3B1wtsHIpHczaTsCTQe.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:33:01', '2026-11-08 21:10:43'),
(267, 'Afnan 9 PM – Bold Sweet-Spicy Night Scent', 'COD20261025267', 'afnan-9-pm-bold-sweet-spicy-night-scent', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '971324550061', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-9dYgvHtUMiObfaMJfUHHbTwmw197O3rPXf9gexxH.webp', '<p>A vibrant sweet-spicy party scent with irresistible vanilla and apple notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Apple, Cinnamon, Wild Lavender, Bergamot</p><p>Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, Lily-of-the-Valley</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amber, Patchouli</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Sweet • Spicy • Vanilla • Amber</p><p>Best For: Evening parties, date nights, special occasions</p>', '<p>Afnan 9 PM is made for the modern man who loves to make an impression. It is a bold, magnetic night scent where sweet apple and warm cinnamon meet creamy vanilla and rich amber, delivering strong performance from the first spray.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a bright, spicy burst of apple, cinnamon, wild lavender and bergamot. At its heart sit soft floral touches of orange blossom and lily-of-the-valley. It dries down into a warm, sweet base of vanilla, tonka bean, amber and patchouli.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evening parties, dinners, date nights and special occasions. A confident sweet-spicy signature for the man who wants to be remembered.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Premium Sweet & Warm Perfume for Men', 'Buy Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) by MH Gallery. Features long-lasting sweet apple, cinnamon & rich vanilla notes. Perfect for evening wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-JAiPfh4DWehyRD7kqddCWtibRI4xlWwJhmI6VHEW.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:41:18', '2026-11-08 11:29:54'),
(268, 'Lattafa Khamrah – Cinnamon, Dates & Praline Warmth', 'COD20261025268', 'lattafa-khamrah-cinnamon-dates-praline-warmth', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '679424142293', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-10-25-JZieMdxA6ZMObDjFLGh8tZ728yCMRFkdCAUEPifa.webp', '<p>Warm cinnamon, candied dates, and creamy praline winter warmth.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Bergamot</p><p>Middle Notes: Dates, Praline, Tuberose, Mahonial</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Benzoin, Myrrh, Amberwood</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Warm • Spicy • Gourmand • Vanilla</p><p>Best For: Winter, cooler evenings, special occasions</p>', '<p>A decadent Middle-Eastern masterpiece. Warm sweet spices, candied dates, creamy praline and rich vanilla make this a cozy, luxurious and long-lasting fragrance.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with warm, spicy notes of cinnamon, nutmeg and bergamot. The heart turns rich and gourmand with dates, praline, tuberose and mahonial. It settles into a creamy, ambery base of vanilla, tonka bean, benzoin, myrrh and amberwood.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Best loved in winter and on cooler evenings, for parties, gatherings and special occasions. A unisex gourmand for anyone who loves warm, sweet and spicy scents.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Khamrah Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Warm Cinnamon & Dates | MH Gallery', 'Order Lattafa Khamrah impression at MH Gallery. Rich cinnamon, dates & praline gourmand notes perfect for cozy winter wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-10-25-ivXZLHlY3AlAi0wP6kl1K2yrkZYkewUjB3ULdj7D.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:45:58', '2026-11-02 07:06:26'),
(269, 'Golden Dust – Honeyed Musk & Creamy Amber', 'COD20261025269', 'golden-dust-honeyed-musk-creamy-amber', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '424173814496', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-pXL84b4Y0liJYiyXFvDoeE1wRXmlclIik5H6az1D.webp', '<p>Smooth honeyed musk, vanilla, and honeysuckle Arabian classic.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Mango, Passionfruit, Grapefruit</p><p>Middle Notes: Honeysuckle, Jasmine, Cedar</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Soft Musk, Amber, Floral Notes</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Honeyed Musk • Vanilla • Amber • Floral</p><p>Best For: Daily wear, Eid, family gatherings, gifting</p>', '<p>A long-standing favorite across South Asia, Golden Dust features a royal blend of soft sweet musk, rich vanilla and warm honeysuckle that stays intimate and long-lasting on skin and clothes.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a juicy, tropical burst of mango, passionfruit and grapefruit. The heart softens into a floral, honeyed blend of honeysuckle, jasmine and cedar. It settles into a smooth, creamy base of vanilla, soft musk, amber and floral notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for daily wear, Eid, family gatherings and gifting. A smooth, Arabian-style unisex scent that feels warm, soft and elegant.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 230.00, 195.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Golden Dust Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Soft Golden Musk & Vanilla', 'Order Golden Dust impression . Smooth honeyed musk, vanilla & honeysuckle delivering timeless Arabian luxury.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-XA9HyKO6diNH4sXaYqPlTYtE0F8aT9jVyEw4seBb.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:49:42', '2026-11-08 21:13:38'),
(270, 'Dior Sauvage – Dark, Crisp & Unforgettable', 'COD20261025270', 'dior-sauvage-dark-crisp-unforgettable', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '890323214943', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-ji0tBc9jUeGjm3ez3T4FQtxRwDIDyP556YoP6T0B.webp', '<p>Beast-mode fresh spicy bergamot & heavy ambroxan projection.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Calabrian Bergamot, Pepper</p><p>Middle Notes: Sichuan Pepper, Lavender, Pink Pepper, Vetiver, Patchouli</p><p>Base Notes: Ambroxan, Cedar, Labdanum</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Fresh • Spicy • Ambroxan • Woody</p><p>Best For: Daily wear, work, night outs</p>', '<p>An iconic composition: fresh Calabrian bergamot spiked with spicy Sichuan pepper, anchored on an intense dose of ambroxan. Dark, crisp and unforgettable, with powerful projection and sillage.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a fresh, peppery lift of Calabrian bergamot and pepper. The heart turns spicy and aromatic with Sichuan pepper, lavender, pink pepper, vetiver and patchouli. It is anchored by a powerful base of ambroxan, cedar and labdanum.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A strong all-rounder for daily wear, work, outings and nights out. Bold and masculine, it suits men who want a scent that announces their presence.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dior Sauvage Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Raw & Refined Sauvage', 'Shop Dior Sauvage impression Extrait De Parfum . Fresh bergamot & heavy ambroxan projection for an unbeatable signature scent.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-lbmEdloUGFq6fpRIAJJriAZPL97kC7VHtYi2DE0o.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-24 19:52:55', '2026-11-08 11:27:55');
