(275, 'Lattafa Khamrah – black and white', 'COD20261025275', 'lattafa-khamrah-black-and-white', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '595420705123', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-aqG1ljQT0GPcm8D6DPMeM0vGHUqT2m8sJxiY5Zop.webp', '<p>Warm cinnamon, candied dates, and creamy praline winter warmth.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Bergamot</p><p>Middle Notes: Dates, Praline, Tuberose, Mahonial</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Benzoin, Myrrh, Amberwood</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Warm • Spicy • Gourmand • Vanilla</p><p>Best For: Winter, cooler evenings, special occasions</p>', '<p>A decadent Middle-Eastern masterpiece. Warm sweet spices, candied dates, creamy praline and rich vanilla make this a cozy, luxurious and long-lasting fragrance.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with warm, spicy notes of cinnamon, nutmeg and bergamot. The heart turns rich and gourmand with dates, praline, tuberose and mahonial. It settles into a creamy, ambery base of vanilla, tonka bean, benzoin, myrrh and amberwood.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Best loved in winter and on cooler evenings, for parties, gatherings and special occasions. A unisex gourmand for anyone who loves warm, sweet and spicy scents.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Khamrah Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Warm Cinnamon & Dates | MH Gallery', 'Order Lattafa Khamrah impression at MH Gallery. Rich cinnamon, dates & praline gourmand notes perfect for cozy winter wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-RRNsWZwZPoR5EOQfcMKqnp0XruVyuKO6Pv2sktS9.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:24:58', '2026-11-08 21:15:53'),
(276, 'Afnan 9 PM – black and white', 'COD20261025276', 'afnan-9-pm-black-and-white', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '448567722663', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-10-25-aXBXFnG3TuknLDWVt16mY6g86zycfEC4J56Uu71f.webp', '<p>A vibrant sweet-spicy party scent with irresistible vanilla and apple notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Apple, Cinnamon, Wild Lavender, Bergamot</p><p>Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, Lily-of-the-Valley</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amber, Patchouli</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Sweet • Spicy • Vanilla • Amber</p><p>Best For: Evening parties, date nights, special occasions</p>', '<p>Afnan 9 PM is made for the modern man who loves to make an impression. It is a bold, magnetic night scent where sweet apple and warm cinnamon meet creamy vanilla and rich amber, delivering strong performance from the first spray.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a bright, spicy burst of apple, cinnamon, wild lavender and bergamot. At its heart sit soft floral touches of orange blossom and lily-of-the-valley. It dries down into a warm, sweet base of vanilla, tonka bean, amber and patchouli.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evening parties, dinners, date nights and special occasions. A confident sweet-spicy signature for the man who wants to be remembered.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Premium Sweet & Warm Perfume for Men', 'Buy Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) by MH Gallery. Features long-lasting sweet apple, cinnamon & rich vanilla notes. Perfect for evening wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-10-25-pKJjTJKMzR0D3NaXoEuBQduGQzKwHgsHk0jFGuBE.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:30:01', '2026-11-02 07:02:25'),
