(278, 'Afnan 9 PM – black', 'COD20261025278', 'afnan-9-pm-black', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '713553214043', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-NtzKZsGIvC84rYU0on4bcp2w6t22r7Yo3lgTGX1T.webp', '<p>A vibrant sweet-spicy party scent with irresistible vanilla and apple notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Apple, Cinnamon, Wild Lavender, Bergamot</p><p>Middle Notes: Orange Blossom, Lily-of-the-Valley</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amber, Patchouli</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Sweet • Spicy • Vanilla • Amber</p><p>Best For: Evening parties, date nights, special occasions</p>', '<p>Afnan 9 PM is made for the modern man who loves to make an impression. It is a bold, magnetic night scent where sweet apple and warm cinnamon meet creamy vanilla and rich amber, delivering strong performance from the first spray.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a bright, spicy burst of apple, cinnamon, wild lavender and bergamot. At its heart sit soft floral touches of orange blossom and lily-of-the-valley. It dries down into a warm, sweet base of vanilla, tonka bean, amber and patchouli.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evening parties, dinners, date nights and special occasions. A confident sweet-spicy signature for the man who wants to be remembered.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Premium Sweet & Warm Perfume for Men', 'Buy Afnan 9 PM Extrait De Parfum (100ml) by MH Gallery. Features long-lasting sweet apple, cinnamon & rich vanilla notes. Perfect for evening wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-NtzKZsGIvC84rYU0on4bcp2w6t22r7Yo3lgTGX1T.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:38:31', '2026-11-08 11:25:47'),
(279, 'Versace Eros – wispy blue', 'COD20261025279', 'versace-eros-wispy-blue', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '316567247486', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-77RiLvu9VJl09yJk7G36ceCSocCP44zObsfuPbYE.webp', '<p>Seductive mint, green apple, and rich vanilla party scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Mint, Green Apple, Lemon</p><p>Middle Notes: Tonka Bean, Ambroxan, Geranium</p><p>Base Notes: Madagascar Vanilla, Virginian Cedar, Atlas Cedar, Vetiver</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Fresh • Minty • Sweet • Vanilla</p><p>Best For: Parties, date nights, evenings out</p>', '<p>Inspired by Greek mythology, Eros opens with an exhilarating blast of mint and crisp green apple before revealing a seductive heart of warm tonka bean. Fresh, sweet and irresistibly tempting.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with an exhilarating blast of mint, green apple and lemon. The heart turns warm and sweet with tonka bean, ambroxan and geranium. It dries down into a seductive base of Madagascar vanilla, Virginian cedar, Atlas cedar and vetiver.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A perfect party and date-night scent for men who love a fresh-sweet, attention-grabbing profile. Great for evenings out and special occasions.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Versace Eros Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – wispy blue', 'Buy Versace Eros impression at MH Gallery. Vibrant mint, crisp green apple & creamy vanilla crafted for clubbing and night outs.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-dsofHlBiWzkrmLCqM9y6lI591MmzUcuvexwGnNuv.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:43:48', '2026-11-08 11:26:37'),
(280, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille – black', 'COD20261025280', 'tom-ford-tobacco-vanille-black', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '851450481147', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-minKvAv398KouGQ7VbcDZBXZQuEg6jSyNErceh1x.webp', '<p>Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices, cacao, and rich vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Tobacco Leaf, Spicy Notes</p><p>Middle Notes: Vanilla, Cacao, Tonka Bean, Tobacco Blossom</p><p>Base Notes: Dried Fruits, Woody Notes</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Tobacco • Spicy • Vanilla • Warm</p><p>Best For: Evenings, winter, special occasions</p>', '<p>Reminiscent of a classic English gentleman\'s club. Opulent aromatic spices, sweet tobacco leaf, rich cacao and smooth vanilla come together in a powerful statement scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a rich, aromatic mix of tobacco leaf and spicy notes. The heart turns smooth and sweet with vanilla, cacao, tonka bean and tobacco blossom. It finishes with a warm base of dried fruits and woody notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evenings, winter and special occasions. A luxurious unisex fragrance for those who like a rich, warm and memorable presence.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 205.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Opulent Warm Spice |', 'Shop Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille impression at MH Gallery. Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices & creamy vanilla for private club elegance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-dwG4gx16vUPuUvvnjnIyr9xCNYWDY8d8i4iXK7z3.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:49:51', '2026-11-08 21:17:44'),
(281, 'Baccarat Rouge 540 – black', 'COD20261025281', 'baccarat-rouge-540-black', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '925908922224', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-U3sBRKjpmy6HMEyyPN9ZsRykmim2DdfqpjAlqDyM.webp', '<p>Viral golden saffron, jasmine, and crystalline amberwood cloud.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Saffron, Jasmine</p><p>Middle Notes: Amberwood, Ambergris</p><p>Base Notes: Fir Resin, Cedar</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Saffron • Amber • Woody • Airy</p><p>Best For: Parties, weddings, special occasions</p>', '<p>A poetic alchemy of golden saffron, radiant jasmine and crystalline amberwood. Its airy yet deeply persistent aura floats effortlessly around you, creating a luxurious cloud that draws endless compliments.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a radiant glow of saffron and jasmine. The heart becomes an airy, luminous cloud of amberwood and ambergris. It finishes with a soft, resinous base of fir resin and cedar.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A unisex luxury scent for weddings, parties and special occasions, and for anyone who loves a viral, head-turning signature. Suits both men and women.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Baccarat Rouge 540 Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Viral Luxury Scen', 'Buy Baccarat Rouge 540 impression at MH Gallery. Luminous saffron, jasmine & amberwood profile with incredible projection.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-U5dGOCukButuSU1ww8GG1GPwQfU3bh4ewXgFzi0N.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-25 16:54:47', '2026-11-08 21:18:31'),
(282, 'Bleu De Chanel – Classy  Woody Aromatic', 'COD20261103282', 'bleu-de-chanel-classy-woody-aromatic', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '919138637998', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-gHAV7zqOI2PL7LLaLtpl8vw6tWF1YXfFkyUr8hbS.webp', '<p>Classy, fresh, and professional aromatic-woody scent.</p><p>Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper</p><p>Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine, Iso E Super</p><p>Base Notes: Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli</p><p>Scent Profile: Aromatic • Woody • Fresh • Citrus</p><p>Best For: Office, daily & casual wear</p>', '<p>A versatile aromatic-woody fragrance made for the modern gentleman. Crisp grapefruit and mint open the scent, which then settles into a refined, warm and woody character. Classy, fresh and professional.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens crisp and fresh with grapefruit, lemon, mint and pink pepper. The heart turns refined and warm with ginger, nutmeg, jasmine and Iso E Super. It rests on a dry, woody base of incense, vetiver, cedar, sandalwood and patchouli.</p><p>Perfect For: The supreme daily driver for the office, meetings and casual wear. Timeless, understated and easy to wear in almost any setting.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bleu De Chanel Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Deep navy blue', 'Shop Bleu De Chanel impression Fresh grapefruit, mint, and woody incense blend for classy everyday office wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-SC4ozBQkeJjap8b5xZetTgPuSgZXxC2GTqS4fRck.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 19:22:41', '2026-11-08 11:23:27'),
(283, 'Versace Eros – Fresh Mint, Sweet deep royal blue  Passion', 'COD20261103283', 'versace-eros-fresh-mint-sweet-deep-royal-blue-passion', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '966915668836', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-4BtNjRGqRYxYBVU5NepYmB4wAdrOuCLbD5TOs3ws.webp', '<p>Seductive mint, green apple, and rich vanilla party scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Mint, Green Apple, Lemon</p><p>Middle Notes: Tonka Bean, Ambroxan, Geranium</p><p>Base Notes: Madagascar Vanilla, Virginian Cedar, Atlas Cedar, Vetiver</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Fresh • Minty • Sweet • Vanilla</p><p>Best For: Parties, date nights, evenings out</p>', '<p>Inspired by Greek mythology, Eros opens with an exhilarating blast of mint and crisp green apple before revealing a seductive heart of warm tonka bean. Fresh, sweet and irresistibly tempting.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with an exhilarating blast of mint, green apple and lemon. The heart turns warm and sweet with tonka bean, ambroxan and geranium. It dries down into a seductive base of Madagascar vanilla, Virginian cedar, Atlas cedar and vetiver.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A perfect party and date-night scent for men who love a fresh-sweet, attention-grabbing profile. Great for evenings out and special occasions.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Versace Eros Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Passionate Sweet deep royal blue', 'Buy Versace Eros impression at MH Gallery. Vibrant mint, crisp green apple & creamy vanilla crafted for clubbing and night outs.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-omqswoI6c7HColR3D0dUR9BC2mXQwMncJvA29Dvk.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 19:28:02', '2026-11-08 11:24:09'),
(284, 'YSL Black Opium – Addictive Deep Royal Blue', 'COD20261103284', 'ysl-black-opium-addictive-deep-royal-blue', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '903256393166', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-zCgHcopN8lORnKDKHgYEqln8nHU8RlKKVUZf86eC.webp', '<p>Addictive black coffee, vanilla, and sweet floral nighttime aura.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Pear, Pink Pepper, Orange Blossom</p><p>Middle Notes: Coffee, Jasmine, Bitter Almond, Licorice</p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Patchouli, Cedar, Cashmere Wood</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Sweet • Coffee • Vanilla • Floral</p><p>Best For: Night outs, parties, date nights</p>', '<p>A daring scent for the modern woman. Rich shots of black coffee are sweetened with creamy vanilla and soft white flowers, creating a mysterious, highly addictive dark aura.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a sweet, sparkling touch of pear, pink pepper and orange blossom. The heart turns dark and addictive with coffee, jasmine, bitter almond and licorice. It melts into a creamy, warm base of vanilla, patchouli, cedar and cashmere wood.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: The ultimate night-out fragrance, made for parties, dinners, date nights and cooler evenings. Warm, sweet and seductive.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Opium Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Deep Royal Blue', 'Order YSL Black Opium impression, Dark roasted coffee, sweet vanilla & white floral notes for glamorous evening wear.u', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-PiVSWHsXIQ1tEIhLPz6YyBh0aEw2EefVB24tFLHu.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 19:35:17', '2026-11-08 11:35:33'),
(285, 'Choco Musk – Milk Chocolate, Vanilla & Musk', 'COD20261103285', 'choco-musk-milk-chocolate-vanilla-musk', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '730071112655', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-NtYLikdVCRSelqLlCSGb3BlzVSSnzdjuQ7M1UeoR.webp', '<p>Delicious milk chocolate, vanilla, and soft comforting musk.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Milk Chocolate, Warm Vanilla</p><p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Rose, Spicy Notes</p><p>Base Notes: White Musk, Amber, Sandalwood, Myrrh</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Chocolate • Vanilla • Musky • Cozy</p><p>Best For: Everyday wear, casual outings, gifting</p>', '<p>The ultimate sweet comfort scent. It smells like freshly baked chocolate cookies dipped in warm vanilla milk, finished with soft musk. Highly appealing, cozy and loved by all age groups.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with sweet, comforting notes of milk chocolate and warm vanilla. The heart adds a gentle, spicy warmth with cinnamon, rose and spicy notes. It rests on a soft, musky base of white musk, amber, sandalwood and myrrh.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for everyday wear, casual outings, gifting and cooler days. A gentle, comforting unisex scent that is easy to wear and easy to love.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Choco Musk Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Amber Brown', 'Buy Choco Musk impression . Edible milk chocolate, warm vanilla & soft musk blend for a cozy daily gourmand.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-fi4twp7M3UV5lBGgOAV87obBSXs3TBxHRQiptJn3.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 19:42:36', '2026-11-08 21:19:10'),
(286, 'Choco Musk – Milk Chocolate, Vanilla & Musk..', 'COD20261103286', 'choco-musk-milk-chocolate-vanilla-musk-1', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '499458124211', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-MMVR8DcvOA6i9K3xN523ooIDCokfs6x6haxFpRqI.webp', '<p>Delicious milk chocolate, vanilla, and soft comforting musk.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Milk Chocolate, Warm Vanilla</p><p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Rose, Spicy Notes</p><p>Base Notes: White Musk, Amber, Sandalwood, Myrrh</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Chocolate • Vanilla • Musky • Cozy</p><p>Best For: Everyday wear, casual outings, gifting</p>', '<p>The ultimate sweet comfort scent. It smells like freshly baked chocolate cookies dipped in warm vanilla milk, finished with soft musk. Highly appealing, cozy and loved by all age groups.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with sweet, comforting notes of milk chocolate and warm vanilla. The heart adds a gentle, spicy warmth with cinnamon, rose and spicy notes. It rests on a soft, musky base of white musk, amber, sandalwood and myrrh.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for everyday wear, casual outings, gifting and cooler days. A gentle, comforting unisex scent that is easy to wear and easy to love.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Choco Musk Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Silver Grey', 'Buy Choco Musk impression at MH Gallery. Edible milk chocolate, warm vanilla & soft musk blend for a cozy daily gourmand.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-XVUauVXK3kcrngXIQ00f70slTvDbYpcbhsA4pYTA.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 19:48:29', '2026-11-08 21:20:21'),
(287, 'JPG Scandal – Glamorous Honey & Gardenia Sweetness...', 'COD20261103287', 'jpg-scandal-glamorous-honey-gardenia-sweetness', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '575201764664', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-t6LRRTJZaetfLqxzSOmLDrrMtktkF2BnxpKOHziM.webp', '<p>Intoxicating golden honey, gardenia, and caramel sweetness.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Blood Orange, Mandarin Orange</p><p>Middle Notes: Honey, Gardenia, Orange Blossom, Jasmine, Peach</p><p>Base Notes: Beeswax, Caramel, Patchouli, Licorice</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Honey • Gourmand • Floral • Caramel</p><p>Best For: Parties, glamorous nights, special occasions</p>', '<p>An intoxicating, honey-drenched gourmand fragrance. Rich golden honey blends with creamy gardenia and sparkling blood orange, leaving a delicious, long-lasting trail.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a juicy, sparkling burst of blood orange and mandarin orange. The heart pours into a golden, floral blend of honey, gardenia, orange blossom, jasmine and peach. It dries down into a sweet, sticky base of beeswax, caramel, patchouli and licorice.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Made for glamorous nights, parties and special occasions. A sweet, wild and unapologetically bold scent for women who love to stand out.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 226.80, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Scandal Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Smoky Grey', 'Get JPG Scandal impression at MH Gallery. Luscious honey, blood orange & gardenia blended for a sweet, head-turning fragrance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-rFWPm84oiJBZEmIxoWTDHQcVy1SDaeh12MZo9M0e.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 20:22:30', '2026-11-08 11:36:09'),
(288, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille – Rich Tobacco & Creamy Vanilla..', 'COD20261103288', 'tom-ford-tobacco-vanille-rich-tobacco-creamy-vanilla-1', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '726001356177', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-dVaHeqwhgSZBbuj51oglDMNklTZgtcZrINzKd6fS.webp', '<p>Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices, cacao, and rich vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Tobacco Leaf, Spicy Notes</p><p>Middle Notes: Vanilla, Cacao, Tonka Bean, Tobacco Blossom</p><p>Base Notes: Dried Fruits, Woody Notes</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Tobacco • Spicy • Vanilla • Warm</p><p>Best For: Evenings, winter, special occasions</p>', '<p>Reminiscent of a classic English gentleman\'s club. Opulent aromatic spices, sweet tobacco leaf, rich cacao and smooth vanilla come together in a powerful statement scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a rich, aromatic mix of tobacco leaf and spicy notes. The heart turns smooth and sweet with vanilla, cacao, tonka bean and tobacco blossom. It finishes with a warm base of dried fruits and woody notes.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for evenings, winter and special occasions. A luxurious unisex fragrance for those who like a rich, warm and memorable presence.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 300.00, 252.00, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Dark Smoky Grey', 'Shop Tom Ford Tobacco Vanille impression at MH Gallery. Opulent tobacco leaf, warm spices & creamy vanilla for private club elegance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-kmZtUGWllJ33dBFoGFm79CDVp0AgUl7kZ5zHCH6B.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-02 20:32:24', '2026-11-08 21:20:50'),
(289, 'Acqua Di Gio – Fresh Ocean Breeze Classic..', 'COD20261103289', 'acqua-di-gio-fresh-ocean-breeze-classic-1', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '590316862654', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-MnsmxX36yAoQryxblnvJ6YxijDblrwPYzqnalu9i.webp', '<p>Classic ocean-fresh marine perfume for daily and office wear.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Lime, Lemon, Bergamot, Jasmine, Orange, Neroli</p><p>Middle Notes: Sea Notes, Calone, Peach, Freesia, Rosemary</p><p>Base Notes: White Musk, Cedar, Oakmoss, Patchouli, Amber</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Marine • Citrus • Fresh • Woody</p><p>Best For: Daily & office wear, summer</p>', '<p>Inspired by the pristine Mediterranean sea, Acqua Di Gio captures clean marine notes balanced with sunny citrus and light woody undertones. The quintessential effortless fragrance.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens bright and sun-filled with lime, lemon, bergamot, jasmine, orange and neroli. The heart brings a clean, marine freshness with sea notes, calone, peach, freesia and rosemary. It rests on a soft, woody base of white musk, cedar, oakmoss, patchouli and amber.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A classic ocean-fresh choice for daily and office wear, especially in summer and warm weather. Clean, light and easy to wear all day.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 250.00, 212.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acqua Di Gio – Fresh & classic', 'Buy Acqua Di Gio impression Extrait De Parfum at MH Gallery. Crisp marine notes & sunny citrus for timeless daily elegance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-uBDsdCAvU040TkUiMQsNgtzDRCVkxdBbErX18Pel.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 04:25:52', '2026-11-08 11:22:25'),
(290, 'Baccarat Rouge 540 – Luminous Saffron & Amberwood..', 'COD20261103290', 'baccarat-rouge-540-luminous-saffron-amberwood-1', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '994534490875', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-l8FXsbG3IfQzu25W1vovfCCs73xf1v4nQv6mrwNb.webp', '<p>Viral golden saffron, jasmine, and crystalline amberwood cloud.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Saffron, Jasmine</p><p>Middle Notes: Amberwood, Ambergris</p><p>Base Notes: Fir Resin, Cedar</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Saffron • Amber • Woody • Airy</p><p>Best For: Parties, weddings, special occasions</p>', '<p>A poetic alchemy of golden saffron, radiant jasmine and crystalline amberwood. Its airy yet deeply persistent aura floats effortlessly around you, creating a luxurious cloud that draws endless compliments.</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a radiant glow of saffron and jasmine. The heart becomes an airy, luminous cloud of amberwood and ambergris. It finishes with a soft, resinous base of fir resin and cedar.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A unisex luxury scent for weddings, parties and special occasions, and for anyone who loves a viral, head-turning signature. Suits both men and women.</p><p><br></p><p>Available Sizes: 100 ML  |  50 ML  |  10 ML Travel Spray</p>', 0.00, 300.00, 252.00, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Baccarat Rouge 540 Impression Extrait De Parfum (100ml) – Viral Luxury..', 'Buy Baccarat Rouge 540 impression at MH Gallery. Luminous saffron, jasmine & amberwood profile with incredible projection.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-dX4XMwyEpA9mstWIngpNlER7WUmKCLh6uZbZdxKI.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 04:31:45', '2026-11-08 21:32:36'),
(291, 'Choco Musk – Milk Chocolate, Vanilla & Soft Musk', 'COD20261103291', 'choco-musk-milk-chocolate-vanilla-soft-musk', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '795526741765', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-B3MgFPmNcSBdpEe6SmgdBtTQVjWavCSAKxUYPN32.webp', '<p>Smells like fresh-baked chocolate cookies dipped in warm vanilla milk and soft musk.</p><p>Top Notes: Milk Chocolate, Warm Vanilla</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Cinnamon, Rose, Spicy </p><p>Base Notes: White Musk, Amber, Sandalwood</p>', '<p>The ultimate sweet comfort attar. It smells like fresh-baked chocolate cookies dipped in warm vanilla milk, wrapped in soft musk.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with sweet, comforting notes of milk chocolate and warm vanilla. The heart adds a gentle spicy warmth with cinnamon, rose and spicy notes. It rests on a soft, musky base of white musk, amber and sandalwood.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels sweet, cozy and comforting, like warm cookies and vanilla milk. Playful and gentle, it is easy to wear and loved by all ages.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for everyday wear, casual outings, gifting and cooler days. A comforting unisex gourmand.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1500.00, 1230.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Choco Musk – Milk Chocolate, Vanilla & Soft Musk', 'The ultimate sweet comfort attar. It smells like fresh-baked chocolate cookies dipped in warm vanilla milk, wrapped in soft musk.Scent Journey: It opens with sweet, comforting notes of milk chocolate and warm vanilla. The heart adds a gentle spicy warmth with cinnamon, rose and spicy notes. It rests on a soft, musky base of white musk, amber and sandalwood.How It Feels: It feels sweet, cozy and comforting, like warm cookies and vanilla milk. Playful and gentle, it is easy to wear and loved by all ages.Perfect For: Perfect for everyday wear, casual outings, gifting and cooler days. A comforting unisex gourmand.How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-rUuiZ0qLxgqWyr5XPdq9YikH7yITwlj0jFkXCt7I.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 04:50:25', '2026-11-08 23:13:00'),
(292, 'Bleu De Chanel – Classy Fresh Woody Aromatic...', 'COD20261104292', 'bleu-de-chanel-classy-fresh-woody-aromatic-1', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '941307142004', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-A5b3gLnQqcR0KuaJZ7rVrGNA2jbRQtttcjKEBVQK.webp', '<p>Classy, fresh, and professional aromatic-woody scent.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper</p><p>Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine, Iso E Super</p><p>Base Notes: Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli</p><p><br></p><p>Scent Profile: Aromatic • Woody • Fresh • Citrus</p><p>Best For: Office, daily & casual wear</p>', '<p>Shop Bleu De Chanel impression at MH Gallery. Fresh grapefruit, mint, and woody incense blend for classy everyday office wear.</p>', 0.00, 270.00, 229.50, 15.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Classy, fresh, and professional aromatic-woody scent.  Top Notes: Grapefruit, Lemon, Mint, Pink Pepper Middle Notes: Ginger, Nutmeg, Jasmine, Iso E Super Base Notes: Incense, Vetiver, Cedar, Sandalwood, Patchouli  Scent Profile: Aromatic • Woody • Fresh •', 'Shop Bleu De Chanel impression . Fresh grapefruit, mint, and woody incense blend for classy everyday office wear.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-AJNEjVfvIe25xdZOFytmFYaEK1MhUNRi166pFQtN.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 19:36:21', '2026-11-08 11:20:50'),
(294, 'Victoria’s Secret Bombshell Eau de Parfum', 'COD20261104293', 'victorias-secret-bombshell-eau-de-parfum', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '482931507719', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-GVxhHAHP8MxxctHcPXEgUox9FAcPgTMmFjOjOcmM.webp', '<p>Experience confidence, elegance, and irresistible femininity with Victoria’s Secret Bombshell Eau de Parfum. This iconic fragrance features a refreshing fruity-floral scent that creates a captivating and unforgettable impression.</p>', '<p>Perfect for everyday wear, special occasions, and romantic evenings. Its luxurious fragrance adds a </p><p><br></p><p>touch of glamour and sophistication to every moment. </p><p>Experience confidence, elegance, and irresistible femininity with Victoria’s Secret Bombshell Eau de Parfum. </p><p>This iconic fragrance features a refreshing fruity-floral scent that creates a captivating and unforgettable impression.</p><p><br></p>', 0.00, 250.00, 210.00, 16.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Victoria’s Secret Bombshell Eau de Parfum...', 'Experience confidence, elegance, and irresistible femininity with Victoria’s Secret Bombshell Eau de Parfum. This iconic fragrance features a refreshing fruity-floral scent that creates a captivating and unforgettable impression.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-08-OXwxblGh805mcdDXUp6Uhzjw417mWKlIicVgwhkz.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 19:53:21', '2026-11-08 11:37:03'),
(296, 'Asad Lattafa Perfumes  _ Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104295', 'asad-lattafa-perfumes-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '392866144201', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-tWfWdeod7CEzLWTZTV2lKbIqdH86mRS3IQHmKpWo.webp', '<p>amberfresh spicy</p><p>woody</p><p>warm spicy</p><p>vanilla</p><p>sweet</p><p>tobacco</p><p>powdery</p><p>patchouli</p><p>balsamic</p>', '<p><br></p><p>Asad by Lattafa Perfumes is a Oriental fragrance for men. Asad was launched in 2021. </p><p>Top notes are Black Pepper, Tobacco and Pineapple; middle notes are Patchouli, Coffee and Iris; base notes are Vanilla, Amber, Dry Wood, Benzoin and Labdanum.</p><p><br></p><p>Available : 100 ML, 50 ML, 10 ML</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', 0.00, 600.00, 492.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Asad Lattafa Perfumes Arabic perfume', 'Asad by Lattafa Perfumes is a Oriental fragrance for men. Asad was launched in 2021. Top notes are Black Pepper, Tobacco and Pineapple; middle notes are Patchouli, Coffee and Iris; base notes are Vanilla, Amber, Dry Wood, Benzoin and Labdanum.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-feMClCueS7B97vhNUqmUXmdhhrvV8nXutGvrrteC.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:24:37', '2026-11-08 23:24:09'),
(297, 'Lattafa Khamrah - Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104297', 'lattafa-khamrah-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '592012331706', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-U5PYisvPXXdBiyG3wNfB28ERSRF0vlaFZYqTZWEf.webp', '<p>Lattafa Khamrah appeals to fragrance buyers who enjoy rich, dessert-like scents with a luxurious feel at a budget-friendly price. Reviewers frequently highlight its warm, comforting character, strong sweetness, and impressive depth, making it especially popular for evenings, cooler weather, and anyone seeking an affordable statement fragrance.</p>', '<p>Across fragrance reviewers and enthusiasts, Lattafa Khamrah is widely praised for delivering an unusually rich and addictive gourmand experience </p><p>for its price. People often describe it as warm, sweet, cozy, and surprisingly refined, though those who prefer lighter or less sugary fragrances may find it too dessert-like.</p><p><br></p><p>Available : 100 ML,  50 ML, 10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1000.00, 820.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lattafa Khamrah - Arabic perfume..', 'Across fragrance reviewers and enthusiasts, Lattafa Khamrah is widely praised for delivering an unusually rich and addictive gourmand experience for its price. People often describe it as warm, sweet, cozy, and surprisingly refined, though those who prefer lighter or less sugary fragrances may find it too dessert-like.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-LT7XVJycAWDH9CWRl3BORjXRijYCh3Y07vSA8u4i.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:35:32', '2026-11-08 23:24:31'),
(298, 'Afnan 9PM - Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104298', 'afnan-9pm-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '618067955520', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-g4sdDEQyzkiBZBvjeyUpzzmipYOAiUoaCkbzaxFu.webp', '<p>Afnan 9PM is popular among fragrance enthusiasts because it delivers a sweet, crowd-pleasing evening scent profile with strong projection and longevity at a relatively affordable price. Reviewers frequently describe it as a warm, youthful fragrance that captures the appeal of premium sweet-vanilla clubbing fragrances while offering excellent value.</p>', '<p>The overall consensus is that Afnan 9PM offers impressive performance and value, making it one of the most frequently recommended affordable men\'s fragrances in its style. Reviewers praise its </p><p>sweet, warm, mass-appealing character and long-lasting wear, though some find it overrated or too youthful and sugary for their tastes.</p><p><br></p><p>Available : 100 ML,  50 ML, 10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1000.00, 820.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Afnan 9PM - Arabic perfume', 'The overall consensus is that Afnan 9PM offers impressive performance and value, making it one of the most frequently recommended affordable men\'s fragrances in its style. Reviewers praise its sweet, warm, mass-appealing character and long-lasting wear, though some find it overrated or too youthful and sugary for their tastes.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-oNKkBBxMg7htb4UXFsDAABxHyXdOqIkCqKra8Hbz.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:39:09', '2026-11-03 22:39:09'),
(299, 'Armaf Club de Nuit Intense Man- Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104299', 'armaf-club-de-nuit-intense-man-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '763906202993', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-Bdlh2kQgc9kP5g3DWYOrMONMI0Yz24nioDrAkUYr.webp', '<p>Armaf Club de Nuit Intense Man EDT is widely known for delivering a bold, long-lasting masculine scent profile at a budget-friendly price point. It </p><p>appeals to shoppers looking for a versatile signature fragrance that emphasizes strong </p><p>projection, everyday wearability, and a luxury-inspired experience without a premium price ta</p>', '<p>Armaf Club de Nuit Intense Man </p><p><br></p><p>EDT is widely known for delivering a bold, long-lasting masculine scent profile at a budget-friendly price point. It appeals to shoppers looking for a versatile signature fragrance that emphasizes strong projection, everyday wearability, and a luxury-inspired experience without a premium price ta</p><p>Available : 100 ML,  50 ML, 10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1100.00, 891.00, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Armaf Club de Nuit Intense Man- Arabic perfume', 'Armaf Club de Nuit Intense Man EDT is widely known for delivering a bold, long-lasting masculine scent profile at a budget-friendly price point. It appeals to shoppers looking for a versatile signature fragrance that emphasizes strong projection, everyday wearability, and a luxury-inspired experience without a premium price ta', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-VPcgWG9BUW0G3QZ7rLfLNtPjBFfhrtD5aPS3z6sS.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:43:13', '2026-11-03 22:43:13'),
(300, 'Rasasi Hawas - Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104300', 'rasasi-hawas-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '533116526627', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-HY2DH2XHMDFJJeC0qopMnRJRVxSmyfQmSe67qbqb.webp', '<p>Rasasi Hawas Eau de Parfum for Men is a strong fit for someone looking for a versatile, crowd-pleasing fragrance with a fresh yet sweet character that works well for everyday wear and social occasions. </p><p>It has built a reputation for delivering an appealing scent profile and good value, making it a popular choice among fragrance enthusiasts.</p>', '<p>ki Across fragrance communities and customer reviews, Rasasi Hawas is widely regarded as an easy-to-wear, compliment-generating fragrance with a fresh aquatic sweetness. </p><p>Reviewers frequently praise its scent and value, though some longtime fans report that newer batches may not perform as strongly as earlier releases.</p><p><br></p><p>Available : 100 ML,  50 ML, 10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1300.00, 1053.00, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rasasi Hawas - Arabic perfume', 'Lattafa Khamrah appeals to fragrance buyers who enjoy rich, dessert-like scents with a luxurious feel at a budget-friendly price. Reviewers frequently highlight its warm, comforting character, strong sweetness, and impressive depth, making it especially popular for evenings, cooler weather, and anyone seeking an affordable statement fragrance.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-oLICy99uMbcCqT0n56AMDRD3pQyVnQEJvup4Vb5B.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:47:25', '2026-11-03 22:47:25'),
(301, 'Lattafa Fakhar Black- Arabic perfume', 'COD20261104301', 'lattafa-fakhar-black-arabic-perfume', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '568014824798', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-fKpSDoSD0Q1clW6MRtHv2ZP9dMidn34z8AERPeC2.webp', '<p>Lattafa Fakhar Black is popular with fragrance enthusiasts looking for a versatile, masculine scent that delivers strong value for money.</p><p> </p><p><br></p><p>Reviewers frequently highlight its fresh, clean character, solid longevity, and ability to work well across both casual and dressier settings, making it an easy everyday fragrance choice.</p>', '<p>Across fragrance communities and retailer reviews, Lattafa Fakhar Black is widely regarded as one of the stronger budget-friendly designer-style fragrances. </p><p>Users consistently praise its fresh, masculine scent profile and performance relative to its price, though some note that the opening can be divisive before the fragrance settles into a more appealing dry-down.</p><p><br></p><p>Available : 100 ML,  50 ML, 10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1000.00, 820.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lattafa Fakhar Black- Arabic perfume', 'Lattafa Fakhar Black is popular with fragrance enthusiasts looking for a versatile, masculine scent that delivers strong value for money. Reviewers frequently highlight its fresh, clean character, solid longevity, and ability to work well across both casual and dressier settings, making it an easy everyday fragrance choice.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-ztf5DsRAqYzvmSPqRZMX1zkuMMMDEyxG75yh586e.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-03 22:51:30', '2026-11-03 22:51:30');
