(309, 'Lattafa Yara', 'COD20261104309', 'lattafa-yara', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '238046227112', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-OjztvpFIkIq2HGshVrMBKc3tTi2oG0rzMHhtkN5h.webp', '<p>Lattafa Yara is a popular budget-friendly fragrance that appeals to people looking for a sweet, creamy, and easy-to-wear scent profile. </p><p><br></p><p>It is often chosen for everyday use because it balances a playful gourmand character with broad crowd appeal and strong value for the price.</p>', '<p>Lattafa Yara is a popular budget-friendly fragrance that appeals to people looking for a sweet, creamy, and easy-to-wear scent profile. I</p><p><br></p><p>t is often chosen for everyday use because it balances a playful gourmand character with broad crowd appeal and strong value for the price.</p>', 0.00, 900.00, 738.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lattafa Yara', 'Lattafa Yara is a popular budget-friendly fragrance that appeals to people looking for a sweet, creamy, and easy-to-wear scent profile. It is often chosen for everyday use because it balances a playful gourmand character with broad crowd appeal and strong value for the price.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-8PLqgHAFKDYD7ZK3t9s2V9PNfR0mfwjXkdnuWb3c.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-04 10:22:30', '2026-11-04 10:22:30'),
(310, 'Rasasi Hawas Ice', 'COD20261104310', 'rasasi-hawas-ice', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '777168443492', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-iHjINrMzi8G0IZ9RVtALvkwAUZ3BrV7cCN4OZsFp.webp', '<p>Rasasi Hawas Ice appeals to fragrance buyers looking for a fresh, crowd-pleasing scent with a cleaner and more refined character than many sweet aquatic fragrances. Reviewers frequently highlight its crisp, cooling profile, easy wearability, and strong overall appeal, making it a popular choice for warm weather and everyday use</p>', '<p>The overall sentiment around Rasasi Hawas Ice is strongly positive. Fragrance enthusiasts describe it as fresher, smoother, and more refined than the original Hawas, with a cooling fruity-aquatic character that is easy to enjoy. Most praise the scent profile and versatility, while occasional criticism centers on packaging quality rather than the fragrance itself</p><p><br></p><p>available : 100 ML,  50 ML,  10 ML </p>', 0.00, 1200.00, 972.00, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rasasi Hawas Ice', 'The overall sentiment around Rasasi Hawas Ice is strongly positive. Fragrance enthusiasts describe it as fresher, smoother, and more refined than the original Hawas, with a cooling fruity-aquatic character that is easy to enjoy. Most praise the scent profile and versatility, while occasional criticism centers on packaging quality rather than the fragrance itself', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-dYwbqVd63FVpmVI4O5utwgLR3KibbBimiPQyyp90.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-04 10:25:57', '2026-11-04 10:33:17'),
(311, 'Lattafa Maahir Legacy', 'COD20261104311', 'lattafa-maahir-legacy', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '876897775278', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-xOItam2RN8M5z9B0xGbUV16bAqiIWNBwsFLQyFoZ.webp', '<p>Lattafa Maahir Legacy appeals to fragrance buyers looking for a fresh, versatile scent that performs well for warm weather and everyday wear. Reviewers frequently compare it to the much more expensive Parfums de Marly Sedley, praising its refreshing minty character and strong value for money</p>', '<p>The overall sentiment is very positive, with many reviewers describing Maahir Legacy as an impressive fresh fragrance that punches above its price point. It is often recommended as an affordable alternative to Parfums de Marly Sedley, though some users report weaker projection or longevity than expected, especially when first opening the bottle</p><p>available : 100 ML,  50 ML,  10 ML</p>', 0.00, 900.00, 738.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lattafa Maahir Legacy', 'The overall sentiment is very positive, with many reviewers describing Maahir Legacy as an impressive fresh fragrance that punches above its price point. It is often recommended as an affordable alternative to Parfums de Marly Sedley, though some users report weaker projection or longevity than expected, especially when first opening the bottle', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-xEQmnh3RhPqHc1INRaFZOmO529W2InnoeVnmLgjE.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-04 10:28:40', '2026-11-04 10:28:40'),
(312, 'Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense', 'COD20261104312', 'afnan-supremacy-not-only-intense', NULL, 2, 1, 1, 'other', '858436162503', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-7OQp6718sNIPMClALEGIjLP8xLw4NGztkwZUW5G6.webp', '<p>Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense is popular among fragrance enthusiasts looking for a bold, long-lasting scent with strong projection and excellent value. Reviewers frequently highlight its impressive performance and its resemblance to higher-priced fragrances, making it appealing for those who want a statement-making fragrance without a luxury price tag.</p>', '<p>The overall sentiment is strongly positive, with reviewers consistently praising the fragrance\'s longevity, projection, and value. Many fragrance enthusiasts consider it one of the standout options in the Afnan lineup, though some note that its powerful, unsweet profile may not suit everyone or every occasion</p><p><br></p><p>available : 100 ML,  50 ML,  10 ML</p>', 0.00, 1500.00, 1215.00, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Afnan Supremacy Not Only Intense', 'The overall sentiment is strongly positive, with reviewers consistently praising the fragrance\'s longevity, projection, and value. Many fragrance enthusiasts consider it one of the standout options in the Afnan lineup, though some note that its powerful, unsweet profile may not suit everyone or every occasion', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-04-YyyjFfxBeqmRdohyDoVKN9LUaQdFry0xCkt7UVw4.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-04 10:31:38', '2026-11-04 10:31:38'),
(313, 'Pori Gown - 03', 'COD20261105313', 'pori-gown-03', NULL, 3, 1, 1, 'other', '207979242176', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-05-aHEL3y6ukirnku0HIaW5JJFJXSLsrtSxoCHoqPy8.webp', '<p>আকর্ষণীয় পিংক ফ্লোরাল প্রিন্ট।</p><p>সুন্দর ও এলিগেন্ট ম্যাক্সি ডিজাইন।</p><p>ফুল স্লিভ ডিজাইন।</p><p>ফ্রন্টে সুন্দর হিজাব-ফ্রেন্ডলি লুক।</p><p>ঘুরে বেড়ানো, দাওয়াত কিংবা ক্যাজুয়াল ব্যবহারের জন্য উপযোগী।</p><p>ফ্যাশনেবল ও রুচিশীল আউটফিট।</p>', '<p>যারা সিম্পল কিন্তু আকর্ষণীয় লুক পছন্দ করেন, তাদের জন্য দারুণ একটি কালেকশনআপনার সৌন্দর্যে যোগ হোক নতুন মাত্রা! 💗</p><p><br></p><p>স্টাইলিশ ডিজাইন ও আকর্ষণীয় ফ্লোরাল প্রিন্টের এই সুন্দর ড্রেসটি আপনাকে দেবে মার্জিত ও এলিগেন্ট লুক।</p><p><br></p><p>Available size - 50, 52, 54, 56.</p>', 0.00, 1150.00, 931.50, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pori Gown- 03', 'আকর্ষণীয় পিংক ফ্লোরাল প্রিন্ট।\r\nসুন্দর ও এলিগেন্ট ম্যাক্সি ডিজাইন।\r\nফুল স্লিভ ডিজাইন।\r\nফ্রন্টে সুন্দর হিজাব-ফ্রেন্ডলি লুক।\r\nঘুরে বেড়ানো, দাওয়াত কিংবা ক্যাজুয়াল ব্যবহারের জন্য উপযোগী।\r\nফ্যাশনেবল ও রুচিশীল আউটফিট।', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-05-G2LBgJ9ybiJHJMNOM7uEiKCVZCWuZBjeQDqxyiOe.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05 00:09:38', '2026-11-05 00:09:38'),
