(347, 'বর্গ প্যাকেজ | Borgo Dry Fish Package', 'COD20261106347', 'brg-pzakej-borgo-dry-fish-package', NULL, 1, 1, 1, '', '403450643098', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-06-6MvdGmVAveip8V04MOckXjftCqVAvu1l6d1hjL9c.webp', '<p>এক প্যাকেজে ৪ ধরনের বাছাই করা শুঁটকি—পুঁটির চ্যাপা মেগা, ফাইস্যার চ্যাপা, নদীর কাচকি ও লইট্টা শুঁটকি (টেকনাফ)। ভর্তা, ভুনা ও তরকারির জন্য আদর্শ ৫০০ গ্রাম বর্গ প্যাকেজের সঙ্গে থাকছে ৫০ গ্রাম নদীর গুড়া চিংড়ি শুঁটকি ফ্রি গিফট। সারাদেশে ফ্রি ক্যাশ অন হোম ডেলিভারি</p>', '<p>বর্গ প্যাকেজ শুঁটকি | ৪ ধরনের সেরা Shutki Combo</p><p>বর্গ প্যাকেজ শুঁটকি — এক প্যাকেজে চার স্বাদের আয়োজন</p><p><br></p><p>শুঁটকির ভর্তা, ভুনা কিংবা ঝাল ঝোল—যে রান্নাই হোক, ভালো শুঁটকিই পারে খাবারের স্বাদ কয়েকগুণ বাড়িয়ে দিতে। তাই শুঁটকিপ্রেমীদের জন্য সাজানো হয়েছে বর্গ প্যাকেজ—এক প্যাকেজে দেশি, নদীর ও সামুদ্রিক শুঁটকির বৈচিত্র্য, সঙ্গে থাকছে উপহার।</p>', 0.00, 1400.00, 1260.00, 10.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'বর্গ প্যাকেজ | Borgo Dry Fish Package', 'বর্গ প্যাকেজ শুঁটকি | ৪ ধরনের সেরা Shutki Combo\r\nবর্গ প্যাকেজ শুঁটকি — এক প্যাকেজে চার স্বাদের আয়োজন\r\n\r\nশুঁটকির ভর্তা, ভুনা কিংবা ঝাল ঝোল—যে রান্নাই হোক, ভালো শুঁটকিই পারে খাবারের স্বাদ কয়েকগুণ বাড়িয়ে দিতে। তাই শুঁটকিপ্রেমীদের জন্য সাজানো হয়েছে বর্গ প্যাকেজ—এক প্যাকেজে দেশি, নদীর ও সামুদ্রিক শুঁটকির বৈচিত্র্য, সঙ্গে থাকছে উপহার।', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-06-outQNPixsuMLeEldaUoERRkvesL5cmYG8daGtzR1.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05 21:51:10', '2026-11-05 21:52:31'),
(348, 'Blue Berry – Juicy Blueberry & Creamy Vanilla- 01', 'COD20261107348', 'blue-berry-juicy-blueberry-creamy-vanilla-01', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '471670435094', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-GHQ7jXL4aq6uHceDut9eZBPfU0milCX6MJs4oRiS.webp', '<p>A vibrant, mouth-watering explosion of fresh, sweet blueberries and creamy vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Fresh Blueberries, Wild Strawberries, Red Currant</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Fruity Accord, Lily-of-the-Valley, Sweet Plum</p><p><br></p><p>Base Notes: Creamy Vanilla, Soft White Musk, Cedar</p>', '<p>vibrant, mouth-watering attar bursting with fresh, sweet blueberries and wild berries, softened by creamy vanilla. Fun, fruity and instantly cheerful.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a juicy, sparkling burst of fresh blueberries, wild strawberries and red currant. The heart turns soft and fruity with fruity accord, lily-of-the-valley and sweet plum. It melts into a creamy, comforting base of creamy vanilla, soft white musk and cedar.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels sweet, juicy and playful, like a bowl of fresh berries with a spoon of vanilla cream. Light, youthful and easy to love.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for daily wear, college, casual outings and warm weather. A fun unisex pick for anyone who enjoys sweet fruity scents.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1400.00, 1148.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Blue Berry – Juicy Blueberry & Creamy Vanilla- 01', 'vibrant, mouth-watering attar bursting with fresh, sweet blueberries and wild berries, softened by creamy vanilla. Fun, fruity and instantly cheerful.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nScent Journey: It opens with a juicy, sparkling burst of fresh blueberries, wild strawberries and red currant. The heart turns soft and fruity with fruity accord, lily-of-the-valley and sweet plum. It melts into a creamy, comforting base of creamy vanilla, soft white musk and cedar.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHow It Feels: It feels sweet, juicy and playful, like a bowl of fresh berries with a spoon of vanilla cream. Light, youthful and easy to love.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPerfect For: Perfect for daily wear, college, casual outings and warm weather. A fun unisex pick for anyone who enjoys sweet fruity scents.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHow To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSize: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-oPMKFB4AbXsqY3fZEcX0wQK5SeCB0D8hao2qtgx3.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-07 03:47:56', '2026-11-08 23:13:49'),
(349, 'Davidoff Cool Water – Ocean Fresh Wave & Crisp Mint', 'COD20261107349', 'davidoff-cool-water-ocean-fresh-wave-crisp-mint', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '916489580479', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-UvE4G2QO15NUpCr1SAyuZYFJaIlkRHkUAwUNpj7s.webp', '<p>Iconic energetic wave of sea breeze, fresh mint, and crisp green accords.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Sea Water, Mint, Green Notes, Lavender</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Sandalwood, Jasmine, Neroli, Geranium</p><p><br></p><p>Base Notes: Musk, Oakmoss, Cedar, Amber</p>', '<p>An iconic fresh, aquatic attar that captures the energy of sea breeze and cool mint. Crisp green accords and lavender keep it clean, sharp and effortlessly masculine.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a cool, invigorating rush of sea water, mint, green notes and lavender. The heart turns smooth and gently floral with sandalwood, jasmine, neroli and geranium. It dries down into a clean, masculine base of musk, oakmoss, cedar and amber.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels crisp, cooling and clean, like a morning swim followed by fresh air. Simple, sharp and never heavy.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Ideal for summer, daily wear, office and casual outings. A timeless, easy everyday attar for men.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1400.00, 1148.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Davidoff Cool Water – Ocean Fresh Wave & Crisp Mint', 'Iconic energetic wave of sea breeze, fresh mint, and crisp green accords.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTop Notes: Sea Water, Mint, Green Notes, Lavender\r\n\r\nMiddle Notes: Sandalwood, Jasmine, Neroli, Geranium\r\n\r\nBase Notes: Musk, Oakmoss, Cedar, Amber', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-tw3spV5hg55WxK9tCPejPXv6BdVdV3o1ZrtnNhJF.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-07 03:50:18', '2026-11-08 23:15:02'),
(350, 'Lattafa Khamrah – Cinnamon, Dates & Praline Warmth- 03', 'COD20261107350', 'lattafa-khamrah-cinnamon-dates-praline-warmth-03', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '797039800855', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-Jvq3hNIJ0QsuE1oRlhYrPRPlV8ztz3EZIALetqyG.webp', '<p>Decadent Middle-Eastern masterpiece packed with warm sweet spices and candied dates.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Bergamot</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Dates, Praline, Tuberose, Mahonial</p><p><br></p><p>Base Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Benzoin, Amberwood</p>', '<p>decadent Middle-Eastern masterpiece. Warm sweet spices, candied dates, creamy praline and rich vanilla make this a cozy, luxurious attar.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with warm, spicy notes of cinnamon, nutmeg and bergamot. The heart turns rich and gourmand with dates, praline, tuberose and Mahonial. It settles into a creamy, ambery base of vanilla, tonka bean, benzoin and amberwood.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels rich, warm and indulgent, like spiced dates and caramel on a cold evening. The sweetness is thick and cozy, with a glowing, lingering warmth.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Best loved in winter and on cooler evenings, for gatherings, Eid and special occasions. A unisex gourmand for anyone who loves warm, sweet and spicy scents.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1700.00, 1394.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lattafa Khamrah – Cinnamon, Dates & Praline Warmth- 03', 'Decadent Middle-Eastern masterpiece packed with warm sweet spices and candied dates.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTop Notes: Cinnamon, Nutmeg, Bergamot\r\n\r\nMiddle Notes: Dates, Praline, Tuberose, Mahonial\r\n\r\nBase Notes: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Benzoin, Amberwood', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-pBPkbQcFCDBlQnSTvYOpUpIWl1iWmfbkRArusywI.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-07 03:53:43', '2026-11-08 23:16:00'),
(351, 'Jannatul Firdaous – Classic Green Herbal & Rose- 04', 'COD20261107351', 'jannatul-firdaous-classic-green-herbal-rose-04', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '133124293533', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-E2w2bPeTwA4UChyev1lhokqOzAxBurTXOkiFl8dR.webp', '<p>legendary traditional green attar radiating pristine natural freshness and soothing herbs.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Lotus, Cinnamon, Gardenia, Citrus</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Grass, Rose, Jasmine, Herbal Notes</p><p><br></p><p>Base Notes: Amber, Sandalwood, Patchouli</p>', '<p>legendary traditional green attar, named after the highest garden of paradise. Soothing herbs, lotus and rose give it a calm, fresh character.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens fresh and bright with lotus, cinnamon, gardenia and citrus. The heart blooms into a green, herbal garden of grass, rose, jasmine and herbal notes. It settles into a warm, comforting base of amber, sandalwood and patchouli.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels fresh, peaceful and reverent, bright greens and soft rose that slowly melt into a warm, woody skin scent. Clean, calming and easy to love.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: Perfect for Jummah, prayer, Eid and daily wear, and a thoughtful gift for family. Suitable for both men and women.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1400.00, 1148.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jannatul Firdaous – Classic Green Herbal & Rose- 04', 'legendary traditional green attar radiating pristine natural freshness and soothing herbs.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTop Notes: Lotus, Cinnamon, Gardenia, Citrus\r\n\r\nMiddle Notes: Grass, Rose, Jasmine, Herbal Notes\r\n\r\nBase Notes: Amber, Sandalwood, Patchouli', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-oLWQVftMHbSKw