(359, 'Club de Nuit – Smoky Citrus & Birch Powerhouse- 12', 'COD20261107359', 'club-de-nuit-smoky-citrus-birch-powerhouse-12', NULL, 2, 1, 1, '', '729963578839', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-brizvMgC4mCV8ucNA7KyLFRhPMShobFvXG0vB08Y.webp', '<p>Universally acclaimed smoky pineapple and rich birch fragrance for born leaders.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Top Notes: Lemon, Pineapple, Blackcurrant, Bergamot, Apple</p><p><br></p><p>Middle Notes: Birch, Jasmine, Rose</p><p><br></p><p>Base Notes: Musk, Ambergris, Patchouli, Vanilla</p>', '<p>iconic smoky-citrus attar for natural leaders. Bright pineapple and lemon sit over dry birch and deep musk for a confident, powerful presence.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scent Journey: It opens with a vibrant, sparkling rush of lemon, pineapple, blackcurrant, bergamot and apple. The heart is a smoky, floral blend of birch, jasmine and rose. Everything settles into a deep base of musk, ambergris, patchouli and vanilla.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How It Feels: It feels bold, smoky and polished, fruity brightness over a dry, birchy depth. Strong and masculine, with a noticeable trail.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Perfect For: A versatile choice for everyday wear, meetings and night outs. Wear it when you want a confident, executive presence.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>How To Wear: Dab a small amount on pulse points such as wrists and neck. A little goes a long way.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Size: 10 ML Concentrated Attar Oil</p>', 0.00, 1550.00, 1255.50, 19.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Club de Nuit – Smoky Citrus & Birch Powerhouse- 11', 'Universally acclaimed smoky pineapple and rich birch fragrance for born leaders.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTop Notes: Lemon, Pineapple, Blackcurrant, Bergamot, Apple\r\n\r\nMiddle Notes: Birch, Jasmine, Rose\r\n\r\nBase Notes: Musk, Ambergris, Patchouli, Vanilla', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-DGqQJbaK0MIQ4pqOBYJIdXDrocwLr35f1oyC