(370, 'Maajoon Al Rehab Bakhoor- 09', 'COD20261107370', 'maajoon-al-rehab-bakhoor-09', NULL, 1, 1, 1, '', '453801188847', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-JjIVI1D5LjIC3C8vR0jxYh3f2qcxLyNlWNerelY7.webp', '<p>Made in KSA – a floral, musky bakhoor blend with citrusy notes by Al Rehab</p>', '<p>Maajoon Al Rehab is a gorgeous floral bakhoor made in KSA. It is a musky blend with fresh citrusy notes, giving your home a soft and pleasant fragrance.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Highlights:</p><p><br></p><p>• Brand: Al Rehab (Made in KSA)</p><p><br></p><p>• Floral, musky fragrance with citrusy notes</p><p><br></p><p>• Can be burned in an electric bakhoor burner</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Use a small amount at a time and keep the room ventilated</p>', 0.00, 4500.00, 3690.00, 18.00, 'percent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maajoon Al Rehab Bakhoor- 09', 'Maajoon Al Rehab is a gorgeous floral bakhoor made in KSA. It is a musky blend with fresh citrusy notes, giving your home a soft and pleasant fragrance.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n• Brand: Al Rehab (Made in KSA)\r\n\r\n• Floral, musky fragrance with citrusy notes\r\n\r\n• Can be burned in an electric bakhoor burner\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUse a small amount at a time and keep the room ventilated', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-09-NCGhJtkSkSAOqVZ8hORuNb9e5RVKx4PF74lEXevF.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 7, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-07 05:22:31', '2026-11-08 21:40:17'),
