 tasty everyday meal option designed for adult cats. Its appealing fish flavour and crunchy kibble make it a convenient choice for cats who enjoy seafood-inspired meals.\r\n\r\nThe formula is designed to provide balanced nutrition for daily feeding and includes essential nutrients to support your cat\'s general health. Its practical packaging makes storage and portion control easy.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Delicious tuna flavour.\r\n- Crunchy kibble texture.\r\n- Suitable for adult cats.\r\n- Contains essential nutrients.\r\n- Convenient daily meal option.\r\n- Easy-to-serve packaging.\r\nSuitable For: Adult cats aged 1 year and above.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-cmz7nkn9he8WsOx1bysfqgMxW1IFad1nWaVvZ2sD.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 20:23:30', '2026-11-12 20:23:30'),
