L, NULL, 'SmartHeart Adult Cat Food – Chicken & Tuna', 'SmartHeart Adult Cat Food – Chicken & Tuna is a flavourful dry food option developed for adult cats. Combining chicken and tuna flavours, it offers an enjoyable mealtime experience for cats who prefer tasty protein-based meals.\r\n\r\nIts balanced formula contains essential nutrients to support everyday energy, general wellbeing and a healthy lifestyle. The crunchy texture makes it suitable for regular feeding as part of a balanced diet.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Chicken and tuna flavour combination.\r\n- Suitable for adult cats.\r\n- Balanced everyday nutrition.\r\n- Contains essential vitamins and minerals.\r\n- Crunchy dry kibble.\r\n- Suitable for regular feeding routines.\r\nSuitable For: Adult cats aged 1 year and above.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-wloVDqEWNVkgvLaEKUX1DN5M87ObD3yplLTKDwVc.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 20:25:00', '2026-11-12 20:25:00');
