(573, 'Me-O Kitten Dry Cat Food – Ocean Fish', 'COD20261113573', 'me-o-kitten-dry-cat-food-ocean-fish', NULL, 4, 1, 1, 'other', '376081781923', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-uAxWM6daotkbezjPFKJddiCzTpWXzSROoN25CG97.webp', '<p>Me-O Kitten Dry Cat Food – Ocean Fish is specially designed for growing kittens who need proper nutrition during their early development stages. Its delicious ocean fish flavour makes it appealing to young cats, while its balanced nutritional formula supports healthy growth and daily activity.</p><p>The small, crunchy kibble is convenient for kittens transitioning to solid food. It provides essential nutrients to help maintain an active and healthy lifestyle.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Ocean fish flavour.</p></li><li><p>Specially formulated for kittens.</p></li><li><p>Contains essential vitamins and minerals.</p></li><li><p>Crunchy, kitten-friendly kibble.</p></li><li><p>Supports growth and development.</p></li><li><p>Convenient dry food formula.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Kittens from weaning up to 12 months, according to the package feeding guidance.</p><p><strong>Feeding Instructions:</strong> Introduce gradually and provide suitable portions throughout the day. Fresh drinking water should always be available.</p>', '<p>Me-O Kitten Dry Cat Food – Ocean Fish is specially designed for growing kittens who need proper nutrition during their early development stages. Its delicious ocean fish flavour makes it appealing to young cats, while its balanced nutritional formula supports healthy growth and daily activity.</p><p>The small, crunchy kibble is convenient for kittens transitioning to solid food. It provides essential nutrients to help maintain an active and healthy lifestyle.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Ocean fish flavour.</p></li><li><p>Specially formulated for kittens.</p></li><li><p>Contains essential vitamins and minerals.</p></li><li><p>Crunchy, kitten-friendly kibble.</p></li><li><p>Supports growth and development.</p></li><li><p>Convenient dry food formula.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Kittens from weaning up to 12 months, according to the package feeding guidance.</p><p><strong>Feeding Instructions:</strong> Introduce gradually and provide suitable portions throughout the day. Fresh drinking water should always be available.</p>', 0.00, 990.00, 870.00, 120.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Me-O Kitten Dry Cat Food – Ocean Fish', 'Me-O Kitten Dry Cat Food – Ocean Fish is specially designed for growing kittens who need proper nutrition during their early development stages. Its delicious ocean fish flavour makes it appealing to young cats, while its balanced nutritional formula supports healthy growth and daily activity.\r\n\r\nThe small, crunchy kibble is convenient for kittens transitioning to solid food. It provides essential nutrients to help maintain an active and healthy lifestyle.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Ocean fish flavour.\r\n- Specially formulated for kittens.\r\n- Contains essential vitamins and minerals.\r\n- Crunchy, kitten-friendly kibble.\r\n- Supports growth and development.\r\n- Convenient dry food formula.\r\nSuitable For: Kittens from weaning up to 12 months, according to the package feeding guidance.\r\n\r\nFeeding Instructions: Introduce gradually and provide suitable portions throughout the day. Fresh drinking water should always be available.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-3ByRQHgyCV6W1lqJh09WlzQiSVJwalE71Y6bcb8m.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 20:27:01', '2026-11-12 20:27:01'),
(574, 'Walton 132L Direct Cool Refrigerator – WFD-1B6-GDEL-XX', 'COD20261113574', 'walton-132l-direct-cool-refrigerator-wfd-1b6-gdel-xx', NULL, 1, 1, 1, '', '710364504689', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-PTwJoNLY65NuTA7w7uZJfqGHz4xv1OBjRx1KxHfW.webp', '<p> <strong>Capacity:</strong> 132 Liters</p><div><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Direct Cool Refrigerator</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WFD-1B6-GDEL-XX Direct Cool Refrigerator is a practical cooling solution for small families, apartments and personal use. With a 132-liter storage capacity, it provides sufficient space for storing fresh vegetables, fruits, beverages, dairy products and everyday groceries.</p><p>Its compact design makes it suitable for kitchens with limited space. The refrigerator is designed to provide reliable cooling while offering convenient food organization and easy access to frequently used items.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>132-liter storage capacity.</p></li><li><p>Direct cooling technology.</p></li><li><p>Compact and space-saving design.</p></li><li><p>Separate freezer compartment.</p></li><li><p>Convenient food storage arrangement.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for small households.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Small families, couples and personal use.</p>', '<p> <strong>Capacity:</strong> 132 Liters</p><div><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Direct Cool Refrigerator</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WFD-1B6-GDEL-XX Direct Cool Refrigerator is a practical cooling solution for small families, apartments and personal use. With a 132-liter storage capacity, it provides sufficient space for storing fresh vegetables, fruits, beverages, dairy products and everyday groceries.</p><p>Its compact design makes it suitable for kitchens with limited space. The refrigerator is designed to provide reliable cooling while offering convenient foo