(582, 'Walton 125L Chest Freezer – WCF-1B5-GDEL-XX', 'COD20261113582', 'walton-125l-chest-freezer-wcf-1b5-gdel-xx', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '148958806816', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-zLHQVlEzVtE6wkCkd7nGxzBVgD2Ilv8jG5kpfZdN.webp', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 125 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Chest Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WCF-1B5-GDEL-XX Chest Freezer is a practical frozen food storage solution for homes, grocery shops and small businesses. Its 125-liter capacity provides sufficient room for storing frozen meat, fish, chicken, ice cream and other frozen products.</p><p>The chest-style design allows convenient top access to stored items and provides a practical solution for long-term frozen food storage. Its compact size also makes it suitable for locations with limited floor space.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>125-liter freezer capacity.</p></li><li><p>Chest-style storage design.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for frozen food storage.</p></li><li><p>Convenient top-opening lid.</p></li><li><p>Compact footprint.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for home and commercial use.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Small shops, households and personal businesses.</p>', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 125 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Chest Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WCF-1B5-GDEL-XX Chest Freezer is a practical frozen food storage solution for homes, grocery shops and small businesses. Its 125-liter capacity provides sufficient room for storing frozen meat, fish, chicken, ice cream and other frozen products.</p><p>The chest-style design allows convenient top access to stored items and provides a practical solution for long-term frozen food storage. Its compact size also makes it suitable for locations with limited floor space.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>125-liter freezer capacity.</p></li><li><p>Chest-style storage design.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for frozen food storage.</p></li><li><p>Convenient top-opening lid.</p></li><li><p>Compact footprint.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for home and commercial use.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Small shops, households and personal businesses.</p>', 0.00, 30990.00, 28890.00, 2100.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Walton 125L Chest Freezer – WCF-1B5-GDEL-XX', 'Capacity: 125 Liters\r\n\r\nBrand: Walton\r\n\r\nType: Chest Freezer\r\n\r\n\r\nFull Description:\r\n\r\nThe Walton WCF-1B5-GDEL-XX Chest Freezer is a practical frozen food storage solution for homes, grocery shops and small businesses. Its 125-liter capacity provides sufficient room for storing frozen meat, fish, chicken, ice cream and other frozen products.\r\n\r\nThe chest-style design allows convenient top access to stored items and provides a practical solution for long-term frozen food storage. Its compact size also makes it suitable for locations with limited floor space.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- 125-liter freezer capacity.\r\n- Chest-style storage design.\r\n- Suitable for frozen food storage.\r\n- Convenient top-opening lid.\r\n- Compact footprint.\r\n- Suitable for home and commercial use.\r\nIdeal For: Small shops, households and personal businesses.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-IxIF2mRoKwsP6fcGvUJvpzILEmS22RFhi8EokOSH.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 22:20:27', '2026-11-12 22:20:27'),
(583, 'Walton 300L Chest Freezer – WCG-3J0-DDGE-XX', 'COD20261113583', 'walton-300l-chest-freezer-wcg-3j0-ddge-xx', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '506684485829', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-Wq0lF66QVoXicyHSvIMqgB4FX6PL5LMNrTCoCjy8.webp', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 300 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Chest Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton 300L Chest Freezer is designed for users who require a larger frozen storage space. With its 300-liter capacity, it can accommodate a considerable quantity of meat, fish, poultry, frozen snacks, ice cream and other frozen goods.</p><p>Its chest-style construction provides convenient access to stored products and makes it suitable for commercial environments where frozen items need to be stored in larger quantities.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>300-liter storage capacity.</p></li><li><p>Large chest freezer design.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for meat and fish storage.</p></li><li><p>Spacious frozen storage compartment.</p></li><li><p>Convenient top-opening access.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for commercial and household use.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Restaurants, grocery shops, supermarkets and large families.</p>', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 300 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Chest Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton 300L Chest Freezer is designed for users who require a larger frozen storage space. With its 300-liter capacity, it can accommodate a considerable quantity of meat, fish, poultry, frozen snacks, ice cream and other frozen goods.</p><p>Its chest-style construction provides convenient access to stored products and makes it suitable for commercial environments where frozen items need to be stored in larger quantities.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>300-liter storage capacity.</p></li><li><p>La