(584, 'Walton 334L Inverter Freezer – WUE-3C4-GEPB-XX', 'COD20261113584', 'walton-334l-inverter-freezer-wue-3c4-gepb-xx', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '727808533211', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-a3buxmyb0dVkIlZpIRPFlGXoFTqURC7B0UDckhW9.webp', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 334 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Inverter Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WUE-3C4-GEPB-XX Inverter Freezer is designed for customers who need spacious frozen storage with inverter-based operation. Its 334-liter capacity provides substantial room for storing frozen foods, meat, fish, poultry and other temperature-sensitive products.</p><p>The inverter technology helps regulate compressor operation according to cooling demand. Its spacious storage design makes it useful for households, restaurants and small commercial establishments.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>334-liter storage capacity.</p></li><li><p>Inverter technology.</p></li><li><p>Spacious frozen storage.</p></li><li><p>Designed for household and commercial use.</p></li><li><p>Convenient food storage arrangement.</p></li><li><p>Suitable for bulk frozen products.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Restaurants, supermarkets and large households.</p>', '<div><p><strong>Capacity:</strong> 334 Liters</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Walton</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Inverter Freezer</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Walton WUE-3C4-GEPB-XX Inverter Freezer is designed for customers who need spacious frozen storage with inverter-based operation. Its 334-liter capacity provides substantial room for storing frozen foods, meat, fish, poultry and other temperature-sensitive products.</p><p>The inverter technology helps regulate compressor operation according to cooling demand. Its spacious storage design makes it useful for households, restaurants and small commercial establishments.</p><p><strong>Key Fea