(586, 'Samsung Galaxy A07 (4GB/64GB)', 'COD20261113586', 'samsung-galaxy-a07-4gb64gb', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '106397690216', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-6UShHItRXv5HsajYJsV4y7nF14LEL0zzLEOyFh4k.webp', '<div><p><strong>RAM:</strong> 4GB</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB</p><p><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch HD+ LCD</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Samsung</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Samsung Galaxy A07 is an affordable smartphone designed for users who need reliable everyday performance, modern features and an attractive design. It comes with a large 6.7-inch HD+ display that provides a comfortable viewing experience for watching videos, browsing websites, reading and social media activities.</p><p>Powered by the MediaTek Helio G99 processor, the device offers smooth performance for everyday applications and multitasking. Its 50MP main camera allows users to capture detailed everyday photos, while the 8MP front camera is suitable for selfies and video calls.</p><p>The 5000mAh battery provides dependable daily usage, and its modern Android experience makes it a practical choice for students and regular smartphone users.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6.7-inch HD+ display.</p></li><li><p>MediaTek Helio G99 processor.</p></li><li><p>4GB RAM and 64GB storage.</p></li><li><p>50MP rear camera.</p></li><li><p>8MP front camera.</p></li><li><p>5000mAh battery.</p></li><li><p>25W charging support.</p></li><li><p>Side-mounted fingerprint sensor.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Students, first-time smartphone buyers and everyday users.</p>', '<div><p><strong>RAM:</strong> 4GB</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB</p><p><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch HD+ LCD</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Samsung</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Samsung Galaxy A07 is an affordable smartphone designed for users who need reliable everyday performance, modern features and an attractive design. It comes with a large 6.7-inch HD+ display that provides a comfortable viewing experience for watching videos, browsing websites, reading and social media activities.</p><p>Powered by the MediaTek Helio G99 processor, the device offers smooth performance for everyday applications and multitasking. Its 50MP main camera allows users to capture detailed everyday photos, while the 8MP front camera is suitable for selfies and video calls.</p><p>The 5000mAh battery provides dependable daily usage, and its modern Android experience makes it a practical choice for students and regular smartphone users.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6.7-inch HD+ display.</p></li><li><p>MediaTek Helio G99 processor.</p></li><li><p>4GB RAM and 64GB storage.</p></li><li><p>50MP rear camera.</p></li><li><p>8MP front camera.</p></li><li><p>5000mAh battery.</p></li><li><p>25W charging support.</p></li><li><p>Side-mounted fingerprint sensor.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Students, first-time smartphone buyers and everyday users.</p>', 0.00, 22499.00, 21399.00, 1100.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Samsung Galaxy A07 (4GB/64GB)', 'RAM: 4GB\r\n\r\nStorage: 64GB\r\n\r\nDisplay: 6.7-inch HD+ LCD\r\n\r\nBrand: Samsung\r\n\r\n\r\nFull Description:\r\n\r\nThe Samsung Galaxy A07 is an affordable smartphone designed for users who need reliable everyday performance, modern features and an attractive design. It comes with a large 6.7-inch HD+ display that provides a comfortable viewing experience for watching videos, browsing websites, reading and social media activities.\r\n\r\nPowered by the MediaTek Helio G99 processor, the device offers smooth performance for everyday applications and multitasking. Its 50MP main camera allows users to capture detailed everyday photos, while the 8MP front camera is suitable for selfies and video calls.\r\n\r\nThe 5000mAh battery provides dependable daily usage, and its modern Android experience makes it a practical choice for students and regular smartphone users.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- 6.7-inch HD+ display.\r\n- MediaTek Helio G99 processor.\r\n- 4GB RAM and 64GB storage.\r\n- 50MP rear camera.\r\n- 8MP front camera.\r\n- 5000mAh battery.\r\n- 25W charging support.\r\n- Side-mounted fingerprint sensor.\r\nIdeal For: Students, first-time smartphone buyers and everyday users.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-OE8CXPr4qQW0MjKpHMPjdW6G6GqYEQ7BLByV83H2.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 22:33:59', '2026-11-12 22:33:59'),
(587, 'Samsung Galaxy A17 5G (8GB/128GB)', 'COD20261113587', 'samsung-galaxy-a17-5g-8gb128gb', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '153401637577', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-ERdIUFENmnVJNnZCmAvNaU6Bm1zlHXXJZS5dRz3d.webp', '<div><p><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> 128GB</p><p><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch Super AMOLED</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Samsung</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Samsung Galaxy A17 5G is a stylish smartphone designed for users who want a premium display, dependable performance and modern connectivity. Its 6.7-inch Super AMOLED screen provides vibrant colours, rich contrast and a comfortable viewing experience for entertainment and daily activities.</p><p>The Exynos 1330 processor delivers responsive performance for browsing, social media, video streaming and everyday multitasking. Its triple rear camera setup includes a 50MP main camera, supported by additional lenses for versatile photography.</p><p>With 8GB RAM and 128GB internal storage, users get sufficient space for apps, photos, videos and important files. The 5000mAh battery supports extended everyday use.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6.7-inch Super AMOLED display.</p></li><li><p>Exynos 1330 processor.</p></li><li><p>8GB RAM and 128GB storage.</p></li><li><p>50MP main rear camera.</p></li><li><p>13MP front camera.</p></li><li><p>5000mAh battery.</p></li><li><p>25W fast charging support.</p></li><li><p>5G connectivity.</p></li><li><p>Modern Samsung software experience.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Students, professionals and entertainment lovers.</p><h2><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h2>', '<div style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw