-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; font-weight: 600;\">Ideal For:</span> Students, professionals and entertainment lovers.</p><h2 style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ;\"><span style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; font-weight: 600;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>', 0.00, 39499.00, 38299.00, 1200.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Samsung Galaxy A17 5G (8GB/128GB)', 'RAM: 8GB\r\n\r\nStorage: 128GB\r\n\r\nDisplay: 6.7-inch Super AMOLED\r\n\r\nBrand: Samsung\r\n\r\nFull Description:\r\n\r\nThe Samsung Galaxy A17 5G is a stylish smartphone designed for users who want a premium display, dependable performance and modern connectivity. Its 6.7-inch Super AMOLED screen provides vibrant colours, rich contrast and a comfortable viewing experience for entertainment and daily activities.\r\n\r\nThe Exynos 1330 processor delivers responsive performance for browsing, social media, video streaming and everyday multitasking. Its triple rear camera setup includes a 50MP main camera, supported by additional lenses for versatile photography.\r\n\r\nWith 8GB RAM and 128GB internal storage, users get sufficient space for apps, photos, videos and important files. The 5000mAh battery supports extended everyday use.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n6.7-inch Super AMOLED display.\r\n\r\nExynos 1330 processor.\r\n\r\n8GB RAM and 128GB storage.\r\n\r\n50MP main rear camera.\r\n\r\n13MP front camera.\r\n\r\n5000mAh battery.\r\n\r\n25W fast charging support.\r\n\r\n5G connectivity.\r\n\r\nModern Samsung software experience.\r\n\r\nIdeal For: Students, professionals and entertainment lovers.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-KkKRw5AW1usC50pzpIrhy5AfMO5oOOY45S29b5PF.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-12 22:36:03', '2026-11-12 22:36:03');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `code`, `slug`, `category_id`, `uom_id`, `brand_id`, `publication_id`, `product_type`, `barcode`, `file`, `thumbnail`, `short_description`, `description`, `purchase_price`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `discount`, `discount_type`, `discount_start_date`, `discount_end_date`, `sku`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_image`, `custom_barcode`, `favorite`, `trending`, `new_arrival`, `best_seller`, `status`, `created_by`, `updated_by`, `deleted_by`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(588, 'Samsung Galaxy A36 5G (8GB/128GB)', 'COD20261113588', 'samsung-galaxy-a36-5g-8gb128gb', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '595740791597', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-13-uEBvlAWXBD6VZLcIRr6U0kTGT9IqiwRksSC6aYJr.webp', '<div><p><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> 128GB</p><p><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch Super AMOLED</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Samsung</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Samsung Galaxy A36 5G combines a premium-looking design with powerful everyday performance. Its 6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate provides smooth scrolling, vibrant colours and an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor, the phone is suitable for multitasking, entertainment, gaming and productivity. The 50MP triple rear camera system helps capture detailed photos in different lighting conditions.</p><p>Its 5000mAh battery and 45W charging support provide convenient power management for busy users. The device also features IP67 water and dust resistance.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display.</p></li><li><p>120Hz refresh rate.</p></li><li><p>Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor.</p></li><li><p>8GB RAM and 128GB storage.</p></li><li><p>50MP triple rear camera.</p></li><li><p>12MP front camera.</p></li><li><p>5000mAh battery.</p></li><li><p>45W fast charging.</p></li><li><p>IP67 water and dust resistance.</p></li><li><p>5G network support.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Photography enthusiasts, gamers and professionals.</p>', '<div><p><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> 128GB</p><p><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch Super AMOLED</p><p><strong>Brand:</strong> Samsung</p></div><p><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p>The Samsung Galaxy A36 5G combines a premium-looking design with powerful everyday performance. Its 6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate provides smooth scrolling, vibrant colours and an immersive viewing experience.</p><p>Powered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor, the phone is suitable for multitasking, entertainment, gaming and productivity. The 50MP triple rear camera system helps capture detailed photos in different lighting conditions.</p><p>Its 5000mAh battery and 45W charging support provide convenient power management for busy users. The device also features IP67 water and dust resistance.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display.</p></li><li><p>120Hz refresh rate.</p></li><li><p>Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor.</p></li><li><p>8GB RAM and 128GB storage.</p></li><li><p>50MP triple rear camera.</p></li><li><p>12MP front camera.</p></li><li><p>5000mAh battery.</p></li><li><p>45W fast charging.</p></li><li><p>IP67 water and dust resistance.</p></li><li><p>5G network support.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Photography enthusiasts, gamers and professionals.</p>', 0.00, 43999.00, 42699.00, 1300.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Samsung Galaxy A36 5G (8GB/128GB)', 'RAM: 8GB\r\n\r\nStorage: 128GB\r\n\r\nDisplay: 6.7-inch Super AMOLED\r\n\r\nBrand: Samsung\r\n\r\n\r\nFull Description:\r\n\r\nThe Samsung Galaxy A36 5G combines a premium-looking design with powerful everyday performance. Its 6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate provides smooth scrolling, vibrant colours and an immersive viewing experience.\r\n\r\nPowered by the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor, the phone is suitable for multitasking, entertainment, gaming and productivity. The 50MP triple rear camera system helps capture detailed photos in different lighting conditions.\r\n\r\nIts 5000mAh battery and 45W charging support provide convenient power management for busy users. The device also features IP67 water and dust resistance.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- 6.7-inch FHD+ Super AMOLED display.\r\n- 120Hz refresh rate.\r\n- Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor.\r\n- 