autiful floral embroidered prayer dress designed for comfort, modesty and elegance. Made with soft and breathable fabric, this prayer dress offers full coverage and a graceful appearance for daily Salah, Quran recitation and Islamic gatherings. The delicate floral embroidery adds a premium touch, making it a lovely choice for both everyday worship and special occasions.', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-22-5Aaf0oEzAY6omtMm8DzLgirlTifJgYAA11gilOSm.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-21 21:56:35', '2026-11-21 21:56:35');
