(971, 'Premium Floral Crystal Necklace Set', 'COD20261122971', 'premium-floral-crystal-necklace-set', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'other', '850451007171', NULL, 'storage/media/product/2026-11-22-5SHUhChMs7NYB9OxNCet5PfIEl9zO4NOkxoZqqEg.webp', '<p>Material: Gold-plated alloy &amp; crystal stones</p><p>Set: Necklace + Matching Earrings</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Elevate your style with this Premium Floral Crystal Necklace Set. Featuring beautifully detailed floral patterns, sparkling crystal stones and elegant teardrop accents, this jewellery set is designed to make you stand out at weddings, parties, receptions and festive occasions. The matching earrings complete the luxurious look, making it a perfect choice for traditional and party outfits.</p><ul><li><p>Elegant floral design</p></li><li><p>Sparkling crystal stone decoration</p></li><li><p>Premium gold-tone finish</p></li><li><p>Matching earrings included</p></li><li><p>Suitable for weddings, parties and festive events</p></li><li><p>Perfect gift for special occasions</p></li></ul>', '<p>Material: Gold-plated alloy &amp; crystal stones</p><p>Set: Necklace + Matching Earrings</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Elevate your style with this Premium Floral Crystal Necklace Set. Featuring beautifully detailed floral patterns, sparkling crystal stones and elegant teardrop accents, this jewellery set is designed to make you stand out at weddings, parties, receptions and festive occasions. The matching earrings complete the luxurious look, making it a perfect choice for traditional and party outfits.</p><ul><li><p>Elegant floral design</p></li><li><p>Sparkling crystal stone decoration</p></li><li><p>Premium gold-tone finish</p></li><li><p>Matching earrings included</p></li><li><p>Suitable for weddings, parties and festive events</p></li><li><p>Perfect gift for special occasions</p></li></ul>', 0.00, 1590.00, 1390.00, 200.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Premium Floral Crystal Necklace Set', 'Material: Gold-plated alloy & crystal stones\r\n\r\nSet: Necklace + Matching Earrings\r\n\r\nFull Description (English):\r\n\r\nElevate your style with this Premium Floral Crystal Necklace Set. Featuring beautifully detailed floral patterns, sparkling crystal stones and elegant teardrop accents, this jewellery set is designed to make you stand out at weddings, parties, receptions and festive occasions. The matching earrings complete the luxurious look, making it a perfect choice for traditional and party outfits.\r\n- Elegant floral design\r\n- Sparkling crystal stone decoration\r\n- Premium gold-tone finish\r\n- Matching earrings included\r\n- Suitable for weddings, parties and festive events\r\n- Perfect gift for special occasions', 'storage/media/product/2026-11-22-QOdWzyBMncy4E2UopV7BVUrdt8ZcqzHWKnWs4zQ2.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-22 05:14:35', '2026-11-22 05:14:35'),
